{"id":"2ed883f3deaa5107","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-model8-rank-initial-model.md","title":"ZFC Model8 Rank Initial Model","display":"df-zfc-model8-rank-initial-model — ZFC Model8 Rank Initial Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model8-rank-initial-model","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model8-rank-initial-model","58-df-zfc-model9-rank-initial-model"],"display":"df-zfc-model8-rank-initial-model — ZFC Model8 Rank Initial Model","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-rank]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model8-rank-initial-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model8-rank-initial-model</span><span>58-df-zfc-model9-rank-initial-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model8-rank-initial-model — ZFC Model8 Rank Initial Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"39b5d097687ec105\" href=\"?note=39b5d097687ec105\" title=\"58-df-rank\">58-df-rank</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in V\">\\(M,N\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rank}\">\\(\\operatorname{rank}\\)</span> (ambient rank function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"39b5d097687ec105\" href=\"?note=39b5d097687ec105\" title=\"58-df-rank\">58-df-rank</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZF}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZF}\\)</span> (the Zermelo--Fraenkel theory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{ZF}\">\\((M,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{ZF}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(N,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{ZF}\">\\((N,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{ZF}\\)</span> (metatheoretic satisfaction for the set structures)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel8RankInitialModel}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcModel9RankInitialModel}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel8RankInitialModel}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcModel9RankInitialModel}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}rank\\text{-}initial\\text{-}model} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcModel8RankInitialModel}_S(M,N)\\leftrightarrow M\\subseteq N\\land(M,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{ZF}\\land(N,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{ZF}\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;(x\\subseteq M)\\land\\forall x\\in N\\;(x\\subseteq N)\\land\\forall y\\in N\\;\\forall x\\in M\\;(\\operatorname{rank}(y)\\leq\\operatorname{rank}(x)\\to y\\in M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}rank\\text{-}initial\\text{-}model} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcModel8RankInitialModel}_S(M,N)\\leftrightarrow M\\subseteq N\\land(M,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{ZF}\\land(N,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{ZF}\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;(x\\subseteq M)\\land\\forall x\\in N\\;(x\\subseteq N)\\land\\forall y\\in N\\;\\forall x\\in M\\;(\\operatorname{rank}(y)\\leq\\operatorname{rank}(x)\\to y\\in M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}rank\\text{-}initial\\text{-}model\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel9RankInitialModel}_S(M,N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel8RankInitialModel}_S(M,N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}rank\\text{-}initial\\text{-}model\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel9RankInitialModel}_S(M,N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel8RankInitialModel}_S(M,N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For transitive <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\subseteq N\">\\(M\\subseteq N\\)</span>, ranks of members are absolute, so the ambient rank function is the correct shared parameter; no undefined internal-rank operator is used.</li>\n<li>The model9 rank-initial-model variant is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-rank","status":"resolved","id":"39b5d097687ec105","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-rank]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-rank","status":"resolved","id":"39b5d097687ec105","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{rank}$ (ambient rank function, see [[58-df-rank]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZF}$ (the Zermelo--Fraenkel theory, see [[58-ax-zfc]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rank}","disp